# Hourly image-cache warm-up for the Avina shop, 07:00–22:00 Tehran only (the script also skips 23:00–07:00).

[Unit]
Description=Avina shop — warm the image cache hourly, 07:00–22:00 Tehran

[Timer]
OnCalendar=*-*-* 07..22:05:00 Asia/Tehran
RandomizedDelaySec=5min

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
